#lang scribble/manual
@require[@for-label[racket-base16
                    racket/base]]

@title{racket-base16}
@author{techs-sus}

@defmodule[racket-base16]

This is a DrRacket plugin that replaces the current color scheme's colors and style-delta's with the base16 color configuration found in `~/.config/stylix/palette.json`.
